# VibeTrack Design System

Use this design language for VibeTrack and any project that adopts these rules.

## Visual direction
- Light, calm, minimalist. Soft sage / mist greens on pale paper.
- Not dark mode. Not purple gradients. Not cream+terracotta. Not broadsheet/newspaper.
- One clear visual idea per screen. Reduce clutter. Prefer whitespace over cards.
- Brand name is a hero-level signal (large display type), not a tiny nav label.

## CSS tokens (required starting point)

```css
:root {
  --ink: #24312b;
  --ink-soft: #5d6b64;
  --paper: #f3f6f2;
  --paper-2: #e8eee8;
  --line: #d5ddd6;
  --accent: #3f6f5a;
  --accent-soft: #d9ebe1;
  --white: #fbfcf9;
  --shadow: 0 18px 40px rgba(36, 49, 43, 0.06);

  --display: 'Fraunces', Georgia, serif;
  --sans: 'Outfit', sans-serif;
}
```

Load fonts from Google Fonts: **Fraunces** (display) + **Outfit** (UI).

## Atmosphere
- Do not use a flat single-color page background.
- Use a soft paper base plus subtle radial green washes, e.g.:

```css
background:
  radial-gradient(ellipse 70% 45% at 12% -10%, #dce8df 0%, transparent 55%),
  radial-gradient(ellipse 55% 40% at 100% 0%, #e7efe8 0%, transparent 50%),
  linear-gradient(180deg, #f7faf6 0%, #eef3ee 48%, #e8efe9 100%);
```

## Typography
- Brand / page titles / quotes: `--display` (Fraunces), slightly tight letter-spacing.
- Body / labels / meta: `--sans` (Outfit).
- Section labels: small uppercase, letter-spacing ~0.08em, color `--ink-soft`.
- Primary quote text: large clamp sizing, calm line-height (~1.25).

## Layout
- Centered content column, max-width ~42rem.
- Generous vertical rhythm between sections (~2.25–2.75rem).
- First viewport composition: brand + date + primary focal content (e.g. quote of the day).
- One job per section: one headline, one short supporting line, then the interaction.

## Interaction chrome
- Default: no cards. Prefer hairline dividers and open lists.
- Primary button: filled `--accent`, soft pill radius, short hover lift.
- Inputs: light translucent white, soft green focus ring using `--accent-soft`.
- Checkboxes: custom square boxes; checked state fills `--accent`.

## Motion (ship 2–3 intentional motions)
- Page enter: fade + slight rise.
- Content enter: `rise` keyframe (opacity + translateY).
- Checkbox / button: short transform or color transitions (~0.2s).
- Avoid noisy parallax, glow, or constant looping animation.

## Do / Don't
- Do reuse tokens; avoid new one-off hex colors unless extending the palette intentionally.
- Do keep copy short and quiet.
- Don't introduce purple, neon, heavy shadows, emoji decoration, or dense dashboard chrome.
- Don't put stats strips, promo chips, or floating badges over the hero content.
